==Battleground==
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns.
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*4 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Large Red Ball]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hit Cats]] or [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rusher Cats]] such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] can be used to deal with the Metal Balls. The Red Balls are strong but [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] is enough to deal with them.

